"text":"13Performance evaluation of Tina-OpenR1.C hec kpo in t St ep s (8 259 S te ps per E poch) A IME 2 4 A IM E 2 5 A M C2 3 M ATH 5 0 0 GP QA M in erva Avg .50033.3016.6777.5084.2035.8630.1546.28100033.3323.3380.0085.2024.7532.7246.56150030.0023.3370.0086.0037.8829.0446.04200030.0023.3370.0084.2033.3328.3144.86250036.6726.6772.5084.8041.4133.0949.19300026.6723.3375.0083.6034.3432.7245.94350020.0016.6760.0084.2032.3226.1039.88400033.3323.3372.5083.6038.3827.9446.51450030.0020.0065.0085.0033.8426.8443.45500020.0033.3365.0084.8040.9130.8845.82","level":1,"path_id":"1~18","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":17,"section_id":"sec-1~18"},{"title":"Table 14 :","text":"14Performance evaluation of Tina-OpenThoughts.Ch eckpo i n t S te p s ( 8 75 St e p s p er E poc h ) AI M E 2 4 A I M E 25 A MC 23 M ATH5 00 GP QA M i ne rva Avg .5033.3316.6775.0083.8037.3726.8445.5010016.6720.0070.0083.2033.3326.4741.6115043.3323.3380.0085.0035.3530.1549.5320030.0023.3370.0084.0039.9028.6845.9925033.3330.0065.0083.8034.3428.3145.8030036.6716.6767.5084.4037.8829.7845.4835026.6730.0075.0084.0037.8829.7847.2240036.6723.3372.5084.4032.8327.5746.2245036.6716.6772.5085.6029.2927.5744.7250030.0020.0072.5085.6037.3729.4145.8155030.0023.3377.5084.8036.8731.6247.3560033.3326.6772.5083.8030.3028.3145.8265026.6720.0077.5082.4037.8827.9445.4070036.6720.0080.0083.8035.3531.2547.8575030.0026.6775.0084.2038.8927.5747.0680020.0030.0075.0082.4035.8628.3145.2685023.3320.0072.5085.4036.3630.1544.62","level":1,"path_id":"1~19","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":18,"section_id":"sec-1~19"},{"title":"Table 15 :","text":"15Performance evaluation of Tina-Open-RS3-DrGRPO.5020.0026.6767.5085.4037.8830.5144.6610046.6720.0075.0083.8034.8530.5148.4715026.6720.0072.5084.0037.3730.1545.1220033.3330.0062.5083.4029.8030.8844.99Ch eckpo i n t S te p s ( 1 74 St e p s p er E poc h ) AI M E 2 4 A I M E 25 A MC 23 M ATH5 00 GP QA M i ne rva Avg .","level":1,"path_id":"1~20","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_p